# Fedr, the actor rehearsing on the hill. Three questions, three different
# conversations; a shorter one after `Game.talked` is set.
# Text is a key, not prose: DialoguePanel translates it, so EN/RU stay in
# strings.csv and the language switch keeps working mid-conversation.
# Indent with tabs: DM's INDENT_REGEX is ^\t+.

~ start
if Game.talked.get("actor", false)
	Fedr: LOC_FEDR_AGAIN
	=> END
Fedr: NPC_ACTOR_1
- LOC_FEDR_CHOICE_MASKS
	Fedr: NPC_ACTOR_2
	Fedr: LOC_FEDR_MASKS_1
- LOC_FEDR_CHOICE_VIEW
	Fedr: NPC_ACTOR_4
	Fedr: NPC_ACTOR_3
- LOC_FEDR_CHOICE_SEATS
	Fedr: LOC_FEDR_SEATS_1
	Fedr: NPC_ACTOR_5
=> END
